WEBVTT

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:08.010
There are so many people.

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:09.230
What's going on?

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:11.190
Is there some kind of event?

00:00:16.470 --> 00:00:17.890
Kotobuki-senpai?

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:24.120
Reiji!

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:26.170
Look over here!

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:28.090
Hey, girls.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:30.260
I've got news for you.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:35.470
I'm going to be releasing a solo song!

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.550
You're composing it, right?

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:41.560
Yeah.

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:44.190
Good luck. I know it'll be great.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:46.520
Thanks, Tomo-chan.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.110
Anyway, I hope you enjoy today's performance.

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:47.610
For today's Challenge Corner, we're doing magic!

00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:50.820
Today's theme is hat magic!

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:53.940
Is everyone ready?

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:55.210
Yes.

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:57.980
Just a second...

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.280
Hurry up.

00:03:03.940 --> 00:03:05.010
Otoya.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:11.620
Take it away, Master.

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:18.040
Wow!

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:20.850
What a surprise!

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:26.110
I heard a baby chick 
was supposed to come out.

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:29.480
What? Oh, I see.

00:03:30.700 --> 00:03:35.490
Otoyan and Tokki took so long, it grew up.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:42.150
Sorry...

00:03:42.660 --> 00:03:43.740
Unbelievable.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:44.680
Now, now.

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:47.270
The audience had fun, so what's the problem?

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:48.940
Yes, but...

00:03:48.940 --> 00:03:52.080
That magic trick surprised me.

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:55.380
Rei-chan, you know how it's done, right?

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:56.510
It's a secret.

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:58.420
What? Come on.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:03:59.880
Tell me.

00:03:59.880 --> 00:04:02.810
It just takes practice.

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:04.090
That's right.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:09.970
Today's trick was difficult, but next 
week we're doing card tricks, right?

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:10.980
That's right.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:14.500
I'll practice so I don't mess up next week!

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.280
Let's do our best.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:17.510
That's right!

00:04:17.510 --> 00:04:19.600
I'll do my best, too!

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:21.820
What is that?

00:04:22.110 --> 00:04:24.370
My "working hard" pose.

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:27.310
There's nothing you can't do.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:29.530
That's not true.

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:31.110
What's with the face?

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:32.500
Are you mad?

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.010
Come on, Tokki.

00:04:35.010 --> 00:04:36.500
Please be quiet.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.710
Hey.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:38.940
I'm not angry.

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:40.710
You're lying.

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:44.300
Excuse me.

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:47.150
Hey, kiddo.

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:48.570
Nanami?

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:49.310
What is it?

00:04:49.780 --> 00:04:52.050
She's here to see me.

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:53.020
That's right.

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:58.440
I'm here to discuss his new song.

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:00.510
Oh, right.

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:04.980
The program's next ending song 
is going to be Rei-chan's solo song.

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:06.040
That's right.

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:11.120
Since he's so busy, I came to see him.

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:14.010
I see. So that's how it is.

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:15.190
Oh, right.

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.750
As long as you're here, 
would you like some?

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:18.850
What?

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:24.180
Isn't this Ichinose-san's share?

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:24.630
No.

00:05:25.230 --> 00:05:26.880
This is enough for me.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:30.080
We're having a Kotobuki lunch today.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:31.160
You don't want to miss it.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.320
That's right.

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:34.600
Here. Have some.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:40.820
Fried chicken!

00:05:40.820 --> 00:05:42.480
Today's lunch looks good.

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.110
Really?

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:47.590
Fried chicken is the best Kotobuki lunch.

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:51.530
It's delicious!

00:05:57.610 --> 00:05:58.710
It's so good!

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:00.230
Isn't it?

00:06:00.230 --> 00:06:01.640
Isn't it great?

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.460
Tokki, want a bite?

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:04.600
No, thank you.

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:06.640
You can have two bites, if you want.

00:06:06.640 --> 00:06:07.720
No, thank you.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.250
Three, then.

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:10.930
Why do you keep adding more?

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:16.180
What are you doing after this?

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.310
I was going to go home after our meeting.

00:06:19.310 --> 00:06:21.900
I'll give you a ride partway there.

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:25.210
Are you sure?

00:06:26.810 --> 00:06:29.270
Let's talk in the car.

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:31.770
Okay. Thank you.

00:06:31.770 --> 00:06:33.400
Yahoo!

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:36.080
Let's go!

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:51.380
This is a cute car.

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:53.930
Thanks. But it's old, you know?

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:58.450
I like driving it, but it's 
a lot of work to maintain.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.570
What do you want to do about the song?

00:07:03.460 --> 00:07:08.280
Well, do you have any ideas?

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:10.410
Well...

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:11.790
Oh, I know.

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:14.580
How do you normally compose your songs?

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:16.870
Who, me?

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:26.170
I try to learn about the singer and 
think about them while composing.

00:07:27.050 --> 00:07:29.630
Learn about the singer?

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:34.550
Yes, like how will they 
feel when they sing it?

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:38.100
That's romantic.

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:43.010
Also, how do they see the world?

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:45.510
What do they like?

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:51.190
How do you see me now, then?

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:51.780
What?

00:07:52.190 --> 00:07:53.360
Well...

00:07:53.960 --> 00:08:00.580
You're nurturing, kind, 
and a brilliant idol...

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:01.330
What else?

00:08:06.990 --> 00:08:10.300
I'll have to teach you more about me.

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:13.970
We're going on a tiny detour!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:17.580
What? But what about work?

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:19.600
Not a problem!

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:35.480
If you're hot, open the front window.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:56.260
Taking it easy like this is nice.

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:59.080
You're always so busy.

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:02.610
Being busy has never bothered me.

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.990
I knew I could always quit if I wanted to.

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:05.350
What?

00:09:08.650 --> 00:09:09.820
You can't!

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:11.870
You can't quit!

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:15.450
What? Uh, kiddo?

00:09:15.800 --> 00:09:18.610
Everyone needs you—

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:20.450
It's okay.

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:23.410
I don't think that way, anymore.

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:30.890
I have a pretty long history.

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:35.270
I debuted as a kid, worked solo for a while,

00:09:35.270 --> 00:09:37.780
and appeared in plays, movies, and TV shows.

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:41.000
I had good times and not-so-good times.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:46.170
And somehow after all that, 
I ended up in a group.

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:49.170
You mean QUARTET NIGHT.

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:50.340
Yeah.

00:09:53.570 --> 00:09:57.010
At first, I didn't think we'd do well.

00:09:59.640 --> 00:10:03.290
But you seem to understand each other.

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:07.130
Really? That's how it looks to you?

00:10:11.690 --> 00:10:15.410
Lately, STARISH has been growing rapidly.

00:10:15.410 --> 00:10:16.300
What?

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:22.390
The Cross-Unit Project may have been 
more successful than Mr. Shiny expected.

00:10:22.820 --> 00:10:26.270
All three groups put on 
fantastic performances.

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:28.350
I see.

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:31.160
The members of STARISH don't just get along.

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:32.300
They're united.

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:33.060
What?

00:10:33.060 --> 00:10:41.320
Since meeting and watching them, I started to think I could enjoy singing in a group.

00:10:42.150 --> 00:10:45.290
I'll still work hard on my solo song, of course.

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:48.810
I agree. They love singing.

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:52.440
I love all their smiles, too.

00:10:52.890 --> 00:10:54.460
Also...

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:02.050
Oh, I'm sorry. I got caught 
up in my own thoughts.

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:06.340
I'd like a song that will put 
smiles on everyone's faces.

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:07.310
Okay.

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.740
Leave the singing to me.

00:11:11.740 --> 00:11:15.940
I'll sing your song better than anyone else.

00:11:18.310 --> 00:11:21.860
Pick a card.

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:24.490
This one.

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:29.860
Memorize it and put it back.

00:11:33.140 --> 00:11:34.790
That's not how it goes.

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:35.710
What?

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:39.890
Macho, macho-cho, macho-cho-cho!

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:43.090
You dropped a card. Is that not a problem?

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:45.050
Huh?

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:50.520
Wait. What? It's not here.

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.850
It's probably not good 
to lose track of the card.

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.810
Probably not.

00:11:56.220 --> 00:11:57.520
In fact, it's bad.

00:11:58.810 --> 00:12:02.400
Maybe he's going to make 
a comeback after this.

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:04.340
What kind of comeback?

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:08.480
I'm not very good with my hands, either.

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:11.850
You're the only clumsy one here, Shorty.

00:12:13.650 --> 00:12:16.380
Rei-chan made it look so easy.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:19.340
He's a difficult person.

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:22.120
Yeah, he's amazing.

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:27.300
You're all here.

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:29.990
Haruka, welcome back.

00:12:29.990 --> 00:12:31.880
Did you just get back?

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:33.060
Huh? Yes.

00:12:33.490 --> 00:12:34.900
So this whole time...

00:12:35.340 --> 00:12:40.670
Yes. I know what I want to do 
for Kotobuki-senpai's solo song now.

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:44.850
I'm so excited for Haru-chan's song.

00:12:44.850 --> 00:12:46.740
Me, too.

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.270
<i>He's a difficult person.</i>

00:13:12.490 --> 00:13:14.560
Good evening, kiddo.

00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:16.190
Kotobuki-senpai.

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:20.760
I wasn't expecting 
to run into you here and now.

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:24.950
Could it be fate?

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.830
I can even do this.

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:40.380
How did you do that?

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:41.550
Do you want to know?

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:42.400
Yes.

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:45.090
It's a secret.

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:50.950
What is that?

00:13:50.950 --> 00:13:54.100
I'm going over my interview 
for a fashion magazine.

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:55.740
This late?

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:56.480
Yeah.

00:13:57.550 --> 00:14:01.750
I accepted a new job, 
so I'll be too busy tomorrow.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:04.760
What? But you're already so busy.

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:05.920
Didn't I tell you?

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:08.450
I don't mind being busy.

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:12.330
I'm available to discuss 
my song anytime, too.

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:14.150
Okay.

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:23.520
You may be lonely without me, 
but try to get along.

00:14:23.520 --> 00:14:25.820
Lonely? What are you talking about?

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:27.130
Quiet, fool.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:28.470
Just go.

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:30.200
Aw!

00:14:30.200 --> 00:14:31.880
Wait. What?

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.810
You're actually sad, right?

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:35.810
Shoo, shoo.

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:38.890
Won't you miss your flight?

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:40.370
So cold...

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:46.280
Okay.

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:50.190
Time for work.

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:55.120
Kotobuki-senpai.

00:14:56.550 --> 00:14:58.130
Are you coming with me?

00:14:58.560 --> 00:14:59.620
I'm finished.

00:15:00.750 --> 00:15:01.610
Already?

00:15:01.610 --> 00:15:02.330
Yes.

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:06.500
I'll write the perfect lyrics for this song.

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:09.340
Okay. I appreciate it.

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:11.110
You can count on me.

00:16:08.040 --> 00:16:09.650
It's quiet.

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.540
Rei-chan's gone today for an overseas shoot.

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.340
What?

00:16:23.340 --> 00:16:24.040
It's okay!

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:26.190
I'll handle today's show!

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:27.620
Will you be okay?

00:16:27.620 --> 00:16:30.010
You, too?

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:35.540
Let's get started on 
this week's Challenge Corner!

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:39.310
We'll be learning more magic 
tricks from the master today!

00:16:40.200 --> 00:16:41.580
Master, today—

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:44.730
Otoyan, Tokki, are you working hard?

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:48.230
Hello from the tropics!

00:16:48.230 --> 00:16:49.860
What? Rei-chan?

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.440
Is this some kind of surprise?

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:58.410
Girls in the studio, I'm sad I 
don't get to see your faces today!

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:01.040
Reiji, me, too!

00:17:01.300 --> 00:17:03.840
Thanks!

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:05.430
How are things over there?

00:17:06.490 --> 00:17:12.170
I think you can tell, 
but the ocean is beautiful.

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:14.670
Lucky.

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:16.370
I'm practicing magic...

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:22.810
All by my lonesome. Boo...

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:28.660
We're supposed to perform 
some card tricks now.

00:17:28.660 --> 00:17:31.440
Don't make it harder.

00:17:32.260 --> 00:17:33.950
Sorry, sorry.

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:38.980
See you girls next week!

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:40.620
Good bye!

00:17:44.520 --> 00:17:46.120
Come in.

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:48.250
Good work today.

00:17:48.590 --> 00:17:51.280
What are you doing here, Nanami?

00:17:51.280 --> 00:17:53.420
Did you have work, too?

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:57.160
Yes. I was in the area for a meeting.

00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:58.260
I see.

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:01.100
Is something wrong?

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:04.540
Rei-chan's amazing.

00:18:04.540 --> 00:18:08.310
He just appeared onscreen, 
but he brightened the whole studio.

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:11.110
He stole the show.

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:15.190
We'd better go home and practice!

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.780
Yes. We need to keep up with him.

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:27.830
Good work, guys.

00:18:29.130 --> 00:18:30.460
Kotobuki-senpai?

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:31.300
Rei-chan?

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:32.540
Kotobuki-san?

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:36.010
I'm back. How have you been?

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:39.500
B-But you were just on the broadcast...

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:42.600
Then that means it worked.

00:18:43.080 --> 00:18:44.310
Was that...

00:18:45.770 --> 00:18:48.100
Yeah, a recording.

00:18:48.510 --> 00:18:53.480
So you predicted what we'd be doing?

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:55.360
That's right.

00:18:55.360 --> 00:18:58.320
B-But your timing was perfect.

00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:01.160
It was a huge success.

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:05.290
Now you come with me.

00:19:05.290 --> 00:19:05.950
What?

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.470
I listened to your song.

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:10.170
What did you think?

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:11.580
Get in.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:12.300
What?

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:15.080
Hey!

00:19:22.790 --> 00:19:23.970
What's going on?

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:28.930
He stole the show again.

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:36.690
U-Um...

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.650
How was the song?

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:53.500
I wrote lyrics.

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:58.830
You said you learn about the singer 
before you write your songs.

00:19:58.830 --> 00:19:59.670
Yes.

00:20:00.180 --> 00:20:02.430
I can't lie to you.

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:03.140
What?

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.230
Kotobuki-senpai?

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:17.360
I have to tell you something.

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:21.440
Will you listen, my girl?

00:22:00.880 --> 00:22:04.340
I didn't think you'd find the real me.

00:22:04.740 --> 00:22:07.130
The real you?

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:09.170
I...

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:12.010
...love you.

00:22:12.010 --> 00:22:12.690
What?

00:22:14.490 --> 00:22:16.050
U-Um...

00:22:19.520 --> 00:22:20.100
Huh?

00:22:21.740 --> 00:22:23.190
Just kidding.

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:24.030
What?

00:22:24.350 --> 00:22:26.480
Thanks for the lovely song.

00:22:29.250 --> 00:22:33.010
I hope you'll compose 
QUARTET NIGHT's Triple S song, too!

00:22:34.180 --> 00:22:34.960
I will!

00:24:06.690 --> 00:24:08.890
I love you, my girl.

00:24:08.890 --> 00:24:09.790
Uta Pri.
